  🖋 Crypto: hashing and signing, in Emojicode. The package knows nothing of HTTP
  or of tokens.

    🔨🐇🖋 data❗️ ➡️ digest          💭 SHA-256: 32 bytes
    🎹🐇🖋 data❗️ ➡️ text            💭 lower-case hex

  The README says what each call is checked against, and what the package is
  not for.
